aria-labelledby":"assignment-method-title","children":[["$","h3",null,{"id":"assignment-method-title","className":"chapter-title","children":"求解过程"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"method-kind","children":"遗传–模拟退火混合算法 · HA"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"method-intro","children":"全规模 0–1 矩阵有 375,000 个分配变量。混合算法以每份作品的专家集合表示候选，遗传交叉重组较大范围的分配，负载修复恢复工作量均衡，再通过模拟退火交换局部改进专家对交集分布。"}],["$","$L11",null,{}]]}]],["$","$L12",null,{"id":"assignment","data":{"title":"大规模评审分配的完整算例","source":"2023 华为杯论文，§4.4.2（p. 18）。","protocol":"3,000 份作品分配给 125 位专家，每份作品由 5 人评审，形成 37.5 万个分配变量。统计全部 7,750 对专家的共同评审作品数，以其方差衡量分布是否均匀。对照为 100 次随机平均分配的均值，混合算法运行 56 分 33 秒。","takeaway":"在 37.5 万个分配变量的完整规模上，论文报告的遗传–模拟退火结果将交集方差降低了 11.08%。全部 7,750 对专家平均共同评审约 3.87 份作品，这个平均数由算例规模决定，优化前后保持不变。按报告方差换算，共同评审数相对这一平均水平的偏离幅度（均方根偏差）由约 1.94 份降至 1.83 份，缩小 5.70%。","metrics":[{"label":"专家对交集方差","unit":"","direction":"越低越好","decimals":4}],"groups":[{"label":"完整规模","rows":[{"name":"随机平均分配","values":[3.7662]},{"name":"遗传–模拟退火","values":[3.3488],"featured":true}]}]},"title":"$undefined","children":false}],false,false,[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"related-links","children":[["$","a","/publications#awards",{"className":"text-link","href":"/publications#awards","children":["竞赛记录",["$","$Lf",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M7 7h10v10","key":"1tivn9"}],["path",{"d":"M7 17 17 7","key":"1vkiza"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-up-right","size":15,"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-bottom","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","href":"/projects","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16,"aria-hidden":"true"}]," 返回全部项目"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","href":"/about","children":["关于我 ",["$","$Lf",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$1:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:6:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNo